"""
iOS Peek menu 2.2.0 for exteraGram 12.5.1+ / SDK 1.4.4.3.
Native permission-aware actions, persistent tap menu, optional slide selection,
scrollable cards, bubble-focused previews, reduced motion and frosted snapshot blur.
Motion adapted from Telegram-iOS fb0e62ba8a14; see the accompanying motion notes.
Compatibility failure leaves Telegram's original menu available.
"""

